  <data key="d0">Acute Hepatitis</data>
  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Acute Hepatitis is an inflammation of the liver, observed in the neonate with COVID-19.&lt;SEP&gt;Acute hepatitis is a condition where the liver functions deteriorate suddenly, indicated by elevated transaminase levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Acute hepatitis is a sudden onset of liver inflammation, observed in neonates with COVID-19.</data>
