<node id="COVID-19">
  <data key="d0">COVID-19</data>
  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">COVID-19 is a viral respiratory illness caused by the SARS-CoV-2 coronavirus.&lt;SEP&gt;COVID-19 is the target disease indicated in this case report, affecting the neonates.&lt;SEP&gt;SARS-CoV-2 infection&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to the coronavirus disease 2019 mentioned in the report.&lt;SEP&gt;COVID-19 is a respiratory disease caused by SARS-CoV-2 and has been associated with neurological manifestations, including Guillain-Barré Syndrome.&lt;SEP&gt;SARS-CoV-2 infection, also known as COVID-19, which led to typical symptoms and subsequent long-term effects in the patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ff9630096d279dc8d337ce73d790954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2cca34c71e88accab9345a13cbb98a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc477d943069e397d165d3fc513c4e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18fd428acf2f64b8def73d95b7ae7fe5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e400f404a15117b7828e4faeb89105b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac7c9d342e29c1d5d1cce632be77bcf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eea2cd2f8d466a73d8c53a7c6a597ab9</data>
