  <data key="d2">Metastatic Colorectal Cancer is a type of cancer that has spread from the colon or rectum to other parts of the body, specifically the liver in this case.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastatic Colorectal Cancer is a condition where colorectal cancer has spread to other parts of the body, specifically the liver.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastatic Colorectal Cancer is a form of colorectal cancer that has spread beyond its primary site to other parts of the body.</data>
