  <data key="d0">B Cell Count Trend Post Plasma Transfusion (graph)</data>
  <data key="d1">graph</data>
  <data key="d2">The graph illustrates the post-transfusion recovery of absolute B cell counts in a patient treated with convalescent plasma, highlighting a significant dip and subsequent gradual rise, indicating the effectiveness of the plasma in managing lymphopenia.</data>
