  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">The image illustrates the impact of multiple plasma transfusions on the recovery of effector-memory T cell numbers in a COVID-19 patient with severe immunosuppression, complementing a clinical case report on convalescent plasma treatment.</data>
