  <data key="d2">The image demonstrates the course of anti-SARS-CoV-2 antibody titers and SARS-CoV-2 mRNA levels over four cycles of convalescent plasma therapy, showing a decline in viral load post-treatment in a patient with immunosuppressed conditions.</data>
