  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This graph illustrates the kinetics of anti-SARS-CoV-2 neutralizing antibodies following convalescent plasma transfusions, showing a significant increase in activity levels from pre-treatment to post-treatment, highlighting the potential inflammatory and SARS-CoV-2 neutralizing effects of convalescent plasma therapy in the context of a patient with chronic lymphoid leukemia and comorbid conditions.</data>
