<node id="Swollen Fingers and Toes">
  <data key="d0">Swollen Fingers and Toes</data>
  <data key="d1">symptom</data>
  <data key="d2">Swollen fingers and toes are a clinical sign of chronic arthritis caused by leprosy.&lt;SEP&gt;Swollen fingers and toes are common in leprosy due to joint inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Swollen fingers and toes are a symptom of leprosy-related chronic arthritis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aacfc6d7d3cc205cac72c8b8558bd157&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94513ac90298144829224f0a47c2e282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1eb426e138141a83709091f7abda682</data>
