<node id="Multidrug Therapy (MDT)">
  <data key="d0">Multidrug Therapy (MDT)</data>
  <data key="d1">medication</data>
  <data key="d2">MDT is a treatment regimen used for multibacillary (MB) leprosy.&lt;SEP&gt;Multidrug therapy (MDT) is a combination of antibiotics used to treat leprosy.&lt;SEP&gt;Multidrug therapy (MDT) is the standard treatment for leprosy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aacfc6d7d3cc205cac72c8b8558bd157&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94513ac90298144829224f0a47c2e282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1eb426e138141a83709091f7abda682</data>
