</node>
<node id="Multibacillary (MB) Leprosy">
  <data key="d0">Multibacillary (MB) Leprosy</data>
  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">MB leprosy refers to a severe form of leprosy with multiple bacilli in the skin and nerves.&lt;SEP&gt;Multibacillary (MB) leprosy is a form of leprosy with many bacilli.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aacfc6d7d3cc205cac72c8b8558bd157&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1eb426e138141a83709091f7abda682</data>
