  <data key="d0">Microscopic Slide of Synovial Fluid Smear (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This microscopic image shows a stained synovial fluid smear with a focus on rod-shaped bacteria, indicative of leprosy. The staining highlights the mycobacterial morphology, supporting the clinical presentation of leprosy-related chronic arthritis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94513ac90298144829224f0a47c2e282</data>
