  <data key="d0">Synovial Fluid Aspiration in Leprosy-Related Chronic Arthritis (medical_photograph)</data>
  <data key="d1">medical_photograph</data>
  <data key="d2">The medical photograph visually documents the preparation and performance of a synovial fluid aspiration procedure for a patient with leprosy-related chronic arthritis, showcasing the patient's inflamed and swollen digits, which are key indicators of the disease's progression and treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f1eb426e138141a83709091f7abda682</data>
  <data key="d4">PMC_PMC8184239_01.json</data>
