<node id="Synovial Acid-fast Smear (image)">
  <data key="d0">Synovial Acid-fast Smear (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image illustrates the acid-fast staining of Mycobacterium leprae in synovial fluid, a critical diagnostic tool for identifying leprosy in patients showing symptoms of lepromatous leprosy. The image highlights the dark, rod-shaped bacilli amidst tissue debris under darkfield microscopy, indicative of chronic arthritis associated with leprosy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c09d2a5aee55f57446381e1e10bc52b</data>
  <data key="d4">PMC_PMC8184239_01.json</data>
  <data key="d5">1790438710</data>
</node>
