<node id="Glove and Stocking Hypesthesia">
  <data key="d0">Glove and Stocking Hypesthesia</data>
  <data key="d1">clinical_sign</data>
  <data key="d2">Glove and stocking hypesthesia describes a pattern of sensory loss that corresponds to the distribution of nerve fibers.&lt;SEP&gt;Glove and stocking hypesthesia is a neuropathic phenomenon presenting as loss of sensation in the hands and feet.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94513ac90298144829224f0a47c2e282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1eb426e138141a83709091f7abda682</data>
  <data key="d4">PMC_PMC8184239_01.json</data>
  <data key="d5">1790440797</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
