  <data key="d0">Proximal and Distal Interphalangeal Joints</data>
  <data key="d1">anatomy</data>
  <data key="d2">Proximal and distal interphalangeal joints are the joints in the fingers that are immediately proximal and distal to the distal interphalangeal joints.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94513ac90298144829224f0a47c2e282</data>
  <data key="d4">PMC_PMC8184239_01.json</data>
