  <data key="d0">Osteomyelitis</data>
  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Osteomyelitis is a bone infection that can occur as a complication of leprosy.&lt;SEP&gt;Osteomyelitis is an infection of the bone, often secondary to leprosy-related chronic arthritis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94513ac90298144829224f0a47c2e282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1eb426e138141a83709091f7abda682</data>
