  <data key="d1">patient_cohort</data>
  <data key="d2">Hand and foot deformities are the result of nerve damage and chronic muscle atrophy in leprosy patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Hand and foot deformities refer to changes in the shape of both hands and feet due to chronic arthritis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94513ac90298144829224f0a47c2e282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1eb426e138141a83709091f7abda682</data>
