<node id="RHEZ">
  <data key="d0">RHEZ</data>
  <data key="d1">medication</data>
  <data key="d2">RHEZ is a medication consisting of rifampicin 600 mg, isoniazid 300 mg, ethambutol 1.6 g, and pyrazinamide 1.75 g, prescribed for treating tuberculosis.&lt;SEP&gt;RHEZ is a combination therapy for tuberculosis.&lt;SEP&gt;RHEZ is a medication prescribed to the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;RHEZ is a combination of rifampicin, isoniazid, ethambutol, and pyrazinamide, used for treating tuberculosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-165836f88e88091f092ccedc334c4381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dd181ec075dc20d751360903e9a26f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa8224d75d6912e376e2f1c68d10a040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d87326356ec28ada0f9438ddcbd885d</data>
