<node id="syncope">
  <data key="d0">syncope</data>
  <data key="d1">symptom</data>
  <data key="d2">Syncope refers to a sudden loss of consciousness and temporary loss of posture due to transient global cerebral hypoperfusion, experienced by the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Near syncope is a symptom reported by the patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-165836f88e88091f092ccedc334c4381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d87326356ec28ada0f9438ddcbd885d</data>
