  <data key="d1">symptom</data>
  <data key="d2">Nausea is a feeling of uneasiness in the stomach with an automatic urge to vomit, experienced by the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Nausea is a symptom reported by the patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-165836f88e88091f092ccedc334c4381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dd181ec075dc20d751360903e9a26f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d87326356ec28ada0f9438ddcbd885d</data>
