<node id="chest radiograph of a patient with possible interstitial lung involvement (image)">
  <data key="d0">chest radiograph of a patient with possible interstitial lung involvement (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This radiograph of a supine chest position demonstrates diffuse, patchy opacities with interstitial markings in the lower lung zones, suggestive of consolidation or interstitial lung disease. Additional features include slight diaphragmatic flattening and normal cardiac silhouettes, which may aid in the clinical evaluation of the patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6dc3191a883ccb77f94320837498ccfa</data>
