<node id="Pre-Extensively Drug Resistant Tuberculosis">
  <data key="d0">Pre-Extensively Drug Resistant Tuberculosis</data>
  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Pre-Extensively Drug Resistant Tuberculosis (pre-XDR-TB) is a form of tuberculosis that is resistant to isoniazid and rifampicin and also resistant to second-line injectable drugs but susceptible to fluoroquinolones.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d15eda5686b07a6da217bd63d583b39</data>
  <data key="d4">PMC_PMC8605226_01.json</data>
