<node id="MDR-TB">
  <data key="d0">MDR-TB</data>
  <data key="d1">symptom</data>
  <data key="d2">MDR-TB stands for Multidrug-Resistant Tuberculosis, which refers to a form of tuberculosis resistant to at least isoniazid and rifampicin.&lt;SEP&gt;MDR-TB is a form of tuberculosis resistant to at least isoniazid and rifampicin.&lt;SEP&gt;MDR-TB (Multi-drug resistant Tuberculosis) is mentioned in the context of the patient's contact.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d15eda5686b07a6da217bd63d583b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb618b6665901ffc0f57a25f3a513657&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb37dc355bf610a1523e7d7b2e462a07</data>
