  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Congenital Cytomegalovirus Infection is a disease caused by the cytomegalovirus (CMV) affecting newborns.&lt;SEP&gt;Congenital Cytomegalovirus Infection is a disease caused by the cytomegalovirus.</data>
