<node id="Multibacillary Nodular Leprosy">
  <data key="d0">Multibacillary Nodular Leprosy</data>
  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Unusual presentation of lepromatous leprosy with generalized raised nodular lesions in a 21-year-old man.&lt;SEP&gt;Multibacillary Nodular Leprosy is a form of leprosy characterized by raised nodular lesions.&lt;SEP&gt;Multibacillary Nodular Leprosy is a specific form of leprosy characterized by multiple nodules.&lt;SEP&gt;The disease being discussed is multibacillary nodular leprosy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b29572607c3213ef68a42c95afe1e7de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-535d4f572fe217b62d898b4c97d6bb51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b367f233d3a93db9f073205e4bf895d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cfff69b043c675347f1e3e2ae86480</data>
