<node id="Synovitis">
  <data key="d0">Synovitis</data>
  <data key="d1">symptom</data>
  <data key="d2">The patient presents with synovitis in various joints including MCP 2 and 5, PIP 2 to 4, and wrists.&lt;SEP&gt;Synovitis is inflammation involving the synovial membrane in various joints.&lt;SEP&gt;Synovitis is inflammation of the synovial membrane in the joints, characterized by swelling, pain, and reduced mobility.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0856198c883e2dd5fbb1571ad5fcf281&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1297748dae48df279efa8b98394d0b21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-265f5339bf561dcb610960385773dddf</data>
