  <data key="d0">RA Factor</data>
  <data key="d1">diagnostic_test</data>
  <data key="d2">RA factor and anti-CCP tests were negative in the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;RA Factor is a blood test that checks for the presence of antibodies associated with rheumatoid arthritis.&lt;SEP&gt;RA Factor, or rheumatoid factor, is an autoantibody often present in individuals with rheumatoid arthritis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0856198c883e2dd5fbb1571ad5fcf281&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a7680d902283b4fc12540c4e5c3658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-265f5339bf561dcb610960385773dddf</data>
