<node id="Anti-CCP">
  <data key="d0">Anti-CCP</data>
  <data key="d1">diagnostic_test</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-CCP tests were negative in the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Anti-CCP is a blood test that checks for cyclic citrullinated peptide antibodies, used to diagnose rheumatoid arthritis.&lt;SEP&gt;Anti-CCP, or anti-cyclic citrullinated peptide antibodies, are autoantibodies that are highly specific for rheumatoid arthritis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0856198c883e2dd5fbb1571ad5fcf281&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a7680d902283b4fc12540c4e5c3658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-265f5339bf561dcb610960385773dddf</data>
