  <data key="d0">Musculoskeletal Ultrasound</data>
  <data key="d1">diagnostic_test</data>
  <data key="d2">Musculoskeletal ultrasound was advised and was conducted as per the case report.&lt;SEP&gt;Musculoskeletal Ultrasound is an imaging technique used to examine the musculoskeletal system.&lt;SEP&gt;Musculoskeletal ultrasound is a diagnostic tool used to visualize soft tissues and joints, including the detection of synovitis, bony erosions, and blood flow.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0856198c883e2dd5fbb1571ad5fcf281&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44a7680d902283b4fc12540c4e5c3658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-265f5339bf561dcb610960385773dddf</data>
