  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Seronegative post-COVID-19 inflammatory arthritis (polyarticular) is a condition characterized by joint inflammation in multiple small joints of the hands and wrists after recovering from COVID-19 without positive rheumatoid factor or anti-CCP.</data>
