<node id="Severe_acute_respiratory_distress syndrome (ARDS)">
  <data key="d0">Severe_acute_respiratory_distress syndrome (ARDS)</data>
  <data key="d1">disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Severe acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS) is a lung injury causing inflammation and fluid accumulation in the alveoli.</data>
