<node id="Cerebral Infarction">
  <data key="d0">Cerebral Infarction</data>
  <data key="d1">clinical_sign</data>
  <data key="d2">Cerebral Infarction is a medical sign indicating tissue death in the brain often seen in elderly patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Cerebral Infarction is a condition where multiple advanced stage infarctions are observed in the brain due to reduced blood flow.&lt;SEP&gt;Cerebral Infarction is a medical condition characterized by the death of brain tissue due to a lack of blood supply, resulting in weakness and loss of muscle tone in the left arm.</data>
