  <data key="d2">Anticoagulants are a broad category of drugs used to prevent and treat coagulation dysfunction.&lt;SEP&gt;Anticoagulants are useful in older patients with high D-dimer due to the risk of coagulation dysfunction and cerebral infarction.</data>
