<node id="Ischemic Stroke MRI: Hyperacute to Subacute Phase (image)">
  <data key="d0">Ischemic Stroke MRI: Hyperacute to Subacute Phase (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image depicts an axial slice of brain diffusion-weighted magnetic resonance imaging showing restricted diffusion in the right frontal lobe, indicative of an ischemic stroke. The presence of hyperintense areas suggests the early stages (hyperacute or subacute) of cerebral infarction, likely associated with the patient’s clinical presentation and known risk factors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5434d2404d7232c7144f162bc69cae54</data>
