<node id="Cerebral Diffusion MRI Slice with Hypointense Infarction (image)">
  <data key="d0">Cerebral Diffusion MRI Slice with Hypointense Infarction (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image is an axial Diffusion Weighted Imaging (DWI) slice of a brain, showing restricted diffusion in two distinct regions, indicative of cerebral infarction, as part of a clinical case report on a COVID-19 patient with cerebral events.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-140d3d0c7e1ef87de0cec1328c1d5ae7</data>
