  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">The image is a clinical timeline graph documenting a patient's condition over time, revealing a decline in laboratory markers following the initiation of therapy. It provides a visual summary of treatment progression and its effects on different physiological parameters during a medical case, useful for understanding patient care management.</data>
