<node id="Clinical Course Tracking Chart (image)">
  <data key="d0">Clinical Course Tracking Chart (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This detailed clinical course tracking chart illustrates the evolution of a 44-year-old female patient’s body temperature and PCR test results over 15 days of COVID-19 pneumonia treatment, including the use of Lopinavir/Ritonavir. The chart shows a positive PCR test upon admission, an initial temperature peak, subsequent decline in body temperature under the regimen of LPV/r, and resolution of cough symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eeeea77c44b480e21303b89609a382cd</data>
